        "note": "2026-05-28 — Bucket-1 beta port: keyboard/ARIA contract reviewed, ForcedColors story added, Storybook axe gate (parameters.a11y.test: error). 2026-07-12 — beta→stable: 4-mode AT (base/light/dark/forced-colors) captured on a non-6010 Storybook for all required stories; accessibility tree and real-browser forced-colors confirmed; real Figma component built (replacing the placeholder link). 5 production consumers (form field groups). 2026-10-15: demoted to beta. Its only production consumer was CheckboxGroup, which now names its group with FormField (fieldset and legend): a <label for> names one control, not a group, and CheckboxGroup's pointed at a nonexistent id. Candidate for deprecation in favour of FormField. 2026-10-15 (later): back to stable as the one group heading. Gains as legend; FormField, RadioGroup and the SelectableCard group render it, so it is live through CheckboxGroup on the contact form and the pricing calculator.",
